#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ちょっと…疲れたな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm kinda...tired..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはベッドに横になった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I laid down in bed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴを運ぶのに神経をすり減らしたせいか、
#. 思ってた以上に疲れていたみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it was because of the stress of moving \n"
"Alter Ego, but I was way more tired than I realized.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…ボクはすぐに……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So before long at all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うとうと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I had completely dozed off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>*Bính bong*\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ん……？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hunh...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>*Bính bong*\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>眠りかけていたボクを現実世界に引き戻したのは、
#. 部屋に響くインターホンの音だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sharp sound of the doorbell pierced my sleepy haze\n"
"and pulled me back to the real world.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰だろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Who could that be...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、すぐに来て…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Makoto, get out here."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん…どうかしたの…？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko...? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. さっき、朝日奈さんが私を呼びに来たのよ。
#. 真っ青な顔色でね…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Hina just came to see me, and she was white as a\n"
"ghost."
msgstr ""

#. どうやら…何かあったらしいの…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It sounds like something's happened..."
msgstr ""

#. 何か…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その言葉を耳にした途端、
#. ボクの胸が早鐘を打ち始めた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as I heard those words, my heart started to\n"
"beat a little faster.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>瞬間、脳が目覚める。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I suddenly found myself wide awake.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>娯楽室<CLT>に来てと言っていたわ…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "She said for us to come to the <CLT 3>rec room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …ご、娯楽室だね。
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The rec room...?"
msgstr ""

#. わかった。急ごう！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay! Let's hurry!"
msgstr ""
